# Pairs with EventualConvergence. Folds the held-back writes into the watermark as min(S, minHeld)
# instead of excluding each by identity, so one lost mark blocks every dependent above it for ever.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceLostMarkPinsLowWatermark
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the held-back minimum caps the watermark, so one lost mark pins every later dependent
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
    /\ IF \E i \in bBuf : bdeps[i] \in lost \/ DepsOk(bdeps[i])
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the held-back minimum caps the watermark.
    /\ IF \E i \in bBuf : bdeps[i] \in lost \/ bdeps[i] \in ids \/ (bdeps[i] < srcv /\ bdeps[i] < MinHeld)
--- END

--- FIND
               /\ bdeps[i] \in lost \/ DepsOk(bdeps[i])
--- REPLACE
               /\ bdeps[i] \in lost \/ bdeps[i] \in ids \/ (bdeps[i] < srcv /\ bdeps[i] < MinHeld)
--- END
